HONEST STATUS
-------------
Design / reference prototype. Unaudited. Pre-production. Not a certified
security product. Nothing here ships as-is.

WHAT THIS IS / IS NOT
---------------------
- ADDITIVE to the free personal app suite. The personal apps are free and
  unrestricted, forever. Nothing in this layer disables a personal app or
  locks a person out of their own device or data.
- Business edition: free 6-month evaluation for a corporate master; free
  freemium (up to 3 desktops, 2 years) otherwise. A paid license is required
  after the evaluation — for the enterprise features only.
- Payment is FIAT (invoice / card); pricing is still being structured. Never a
  coin. The Bloch-SIS-PoW coin is not a security, not an asset, and buys no
  software.
- This layer implements NO cryptography and does NOT depend on the licensing
  library's code. The real, offline Ed25519 verify()/mintSub() functions plug
  in through documented interfaces. The token generator lives on posternlabs.com.

The community/free personal suite is never "Postern OS"; Postern OS is the
separate reproducible operating system product.
